re them? They were more numerous than themselves and greater in strength and in impression on the land, but they were not availed by what they used to earn.","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":82,"sd":null},{"k":"40:83","t":"And when their messengers came to them with clear proofs, they [merely] rejoiced in what they had of knowledge, but they were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":83,"sd":null},{"k":"40:84","t":"And when they saw Our punishment, they said, \"We believe in Allāh alone and disbelieve in that which we used to associate with Him.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":84,"sd":null},{"k":"40:85","t":"But never did their faith benefit them once they saw Our punishment. [It is] the established way of Allāh which has preceded among His servants. And the disbelievers thereupon lost [all].","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":85,"sd":null}],"juz":24,"hizb":48,"surahs":[40],"sajdah":false}